trait-language-nekomimetic-name = Nekomimetic
trait-language-nekomimetic-desc = To the casual observer, this language is an incomprehensible mess of broken Japanese. To the Felinids and Oni, it's somehow comprehensible.

trait-language-gary-name = Gary
trait-language-gary-desc = Haha, Gary!

trait-language-NovaCygni-name = Nova Cygni
trait-language-NovaCygni-desc = The state language of the USSP, To most it sounds similar to Sol Common but more rough. Its use has spread through USSP Settlers and Members of the Paycheck Bratva.

trait-language-classicalenglish-name = Classical English
trait-language-classicalenglish-desc = The language of endless wars, territorial conquest, and hunger for dominance. Once the most widespread tongue across all of old Earth before the loss of humanity's homeworld. Speaking this language denies you any knowledge of standard measurements and modern conventions. Exclusive to UGoE supersoldiers who operate under pre-collapse military doctrine.